        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-6 text-charcoal-900">Get Your Power Ready Before the Press Lands</h2>
        <p class="text-steel-700 leading-relaxed">Proper electrical configuration is crucial for safe and efficient operation of hydraulic oil presses. For personalized electrical configuration advice, contact Haonuo's technical support team.</p>
      </section>
